# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit the real key (.env* is gitignored).
# Contact form access key: get a free one at https://web3forms.com
# On Vercel, add the same variable under Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# (Production and Preview), then redeploy: it's inlined at build time.
# Without it the form shows an error state; it never opens the visitor's email app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
